{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ko",
  "strings" : {
    "‘%@’에 있는 기기는 미지정 공간으로 이동합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Delete-room confirmation; the room name is user data",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Devices in “%@” will move to Unassigned."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los dispositivos de “%@” se moverán a Sin asignar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "'Power Base 삭제'는 Power Base가 다시 연결되면 저장된 연결 정보까지 지웁니다. '허브 목록에서 제거'는 되돌릴 수 없으며, 다시 사용하려면 'Power Base 추가'에서 새로 등록해야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management: under the 'remove from hub list' button -- the difference from the removal, that it cannot be undone, and how to use the Base again",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Remove Power Base” also erases the stored connection information once the Power Base connects again. “Remove from Hub List” can’t be undone; to use the Power Base again, register it anew in “Add Power Base”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Eliminar Power Base” también borra la información de conexión guardada cuando la Power Base vuelve a conectarse. “Quitar de la lista del hub” no se puede deshacer; para volver a usarla, regístrala de nuevo en “Añadir Power Base”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘허브 찾기’로 같은 네트워크의 센서 허브를 찾거나, 허브의 주소를 직접 입력하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Settings footer while connecting by a typed address",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use “Find Hubs” to find the sensor hub on your network, or enter the hub’s address yourself."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa “Buscar hubs” para encontrar el hub de sensores de tu red o escribe tú la dirección del hub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘허브 찾기’로 선택한 허브만 설정을 공유할 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings error: sharing needs a hub picked in Find hubs",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settings can only be shared with a hub chosen in “Find Hubs”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo se pueden compartir ajustes con un hub elegido en “Buscar hubs”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘허브 찾기’로 선택한 허브와 설정을 공유할 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings: needs a hub picked in Find hubs",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can share settings with a hub chosen in “Find Hubs”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes compartir ajustes con un hub elegido en “Buscar hubs”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@" : {

    },
