    },
    "Apple 홈이 제시간에 응답하지 않았습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Control Center error: HomeKit didn't load its homes in time",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Home didn’t respond in time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Home no respondió a tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth 등록을 쓰지 않는 Power Base는 컴퓨터에서 펌웨어와 설정 이미지를 기록해 연결할 수 있습니다. 이렇게 연결한 Power Base는 앱에서 삭제할 수 없습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base connection screen: what the computer-based procedure is for",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Power Base that doesn’t use Bluetooth registration can be connected by writing its firmware and configuration image from a computer. A Power Base connected this way can’t be removed from the app."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una Power Base que no usa el registro por Bluetooth se puede conectar grabando su firmware y su imagen de configuración desde un ordenador. Una Power Base conectada así no se puede eliminar desde la app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth가 꺼져 있습니다. 제어 센터나 설정에서 Bluetooth를 켜면 자동으로 찾기 시작합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup: Bluetooth is off",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bluetooth is off. Turn it on in Control Center or Settings and the search starts automatically."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bluetooth está desactivado. Actívalo en el Centro de control o en Ajustes y la búsqueda empezará automáticamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth로 Power Base에 연결하지 못했습니다. Power Base 가까이에서, 전원이 켜져 있는지 확인하고 다시 시도하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup failure: Bluetooth connection failed",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn’t connect to the Power Base over Bluetooth. Move closer to it, make sure it’s powered on, and try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo conectar con la Power Base por Bluetooth. Acércate a ella, comprueba que está encendida e inténtalo de nuevo."
