            "value" : "Verificando la Power Base"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 Thread 네트워크에 연결하고 있습니다. 1~2분 걸릴 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup progress",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base is joining the Thread network. This can take a minute or two."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base se está uniendo a la red Thread. Puede tardar uno o dos minutos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 기다리는 시간이 약 %lld초 남았습니다. 시간이 지나면 아무것도 지우지 않고 원래대로 돌아갑니다." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll confirmation: seconds the board's window had left when it was asked",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "The Power Base waits about %lld more second. After that it erases nothing and goes back to how it was."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "The Power Base waits about %lld more seconds. After that it erases nothing and goes back to how it was."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "La Power Base espera aproximadamente %lld segundo más. Después no borra nada y vuelve a como estaba."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "La Power Base espera aproximadamente %lld segundos más. Después no borra nada y vuelve a como estaba."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 기존 등록 정보를 지우고, 지워졌는지 직접 확인하고 있습니다. Power Base를 끄지 마세요." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll progress: the board erases and verifies",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base is erasing its existing registration and checking for itself that it is gone. Don’t turn the Power Base off."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base está borrando su registro actual y comprobando por sí misma que se ha borrado. No apagues la Power Base."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 기존 등록 정보를 지우고, 지워진 것을 직접 확인했습니다. 아직 새 허브에 등록된 것은 아닙니다. 이제 새 허브에 등록하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll result: reset verified by the board; not registered with the new hub yet",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base erased its existing registration and checked for itself that it is gone. It is not registered with the new hub yet. Register it with the new hub now."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base borró su registro actual y comprobó por sí misma que ya no está. Todavía no está registrada en el nuevo hub. Regístrala ahora en el nuevo hub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 네트워크에 연결했습니다. 허브가 첫 신호를 받으면 등록이 끝납니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup progress: waiting for the hub's confirmation",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base joined the network. Registration finishes when the hub receives its first signal."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base se unió a la red. El registro termina cuando el hub recibe su primera señal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 다른 등록을 처리하고 있습니다. 잠시 뒤 다시 시도하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup failure: another attempt is in progress on the board",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base is busy with another registration. Try again in a moment."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base está ocupada con otro registro. Inténtalo de nuevo en un momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 다른 지우기 요청을 처리하고 있습니다. 잠시 뒤 다시 확인하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll failure: another reset is under way on the board",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base is handling another erase request. Check again in a moment."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base está procesando otra solicitud de borrado. Vuelve a comprobarlo en un momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 다시 연결되면 삭제됩니다. 앱을 닫아도 요청은 허브에 남으며, 그 전에는 취소할 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: waiting for an offline Base",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base is removed when it connects again. The request stays on the hub even if you close the app, and it can be cancelled until then."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base se elimina cuando vuelva a conectarse. La solicitud sigue en el hub aunque cierres la app, y hasta entonces se puede cancelar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 다시 연결되어 목록에서 제거하지 않았습니다. 지우려면 'Power Base 삭제'를 사용하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management failure of 'remove from hub list': the hub hears the Base again",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base connected again, so it wasn’t removed from the list. To remove it, use “Remove Power Base”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base volvió a conectarse, así que no se quitó de la lista. Para eliminarla, usa “Eliminar Power Base”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 아직 삭제를 마치지 못했습니다. 전원을 껐다 켠 뒤 다시 확인하세요. 그사이 다시 등록을 시작한 Power Base는 여기서 확인할 수 없습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Confirm removal failure: the board has no receipt",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base hasn’t finished the removal yet. Turn it off and on, then confirm again. A Power Base on which a new registration was started in the meantime can’t be confirmed here."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base aún no ha terminado la eliminación. Apágala y enciéndela y vuelve a confirmar. Una Power Base en la que se inició un nuevo registro entretanto no se puede confirmar aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 아직 지우는 중입니다" : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll result title: the board has the reset and has not verified it",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base Is Still Erasing"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base sigue borrando"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 요청을 받아들이지 않았습니다. 아무것도 지우지 않았습니다. BOOT 버튼을 다시 5초 누른 뒤 시도하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll failure: generic refusal; nothing erased",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base didn’t accept the request. Nothing was erased. Hold the BOOT button for 5 seconds again, then try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base no aceptó la solicitud. No se borró nada. Vuelve a mantener pulsado el botón BOOT 5 segundos e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 이미 삭제를 마쳤다면 가까이에서 아래 '삭제 확인'으로 완료할 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management: shown with a removal whose result is unknown, above the button that opens the Bluetooth confirmation; offering it does not mean the removal is done",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the Power Base has already finished the removal, you can complete it near the Power Base with “Confirm Removal” below."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si la Power Base ya terminó la eliminación, puedes completarla cerca de ella con “Confirmar eliminación” abajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 지금은 등록을 받지 않습니다. 등록 대기 시간이 지났거나 설정 코드를 여러 번 틀렸습니다. Power Base의 전원을 껐다 켠 뒤 다시 시도하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup failure: the board closed enrollment for this boot",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base isn’t accepting registration right now. Its registration window ended, or the setup code was wrong too many times. Turn the Power Base off and on, then try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base no acepta el registro en este momento. Se acabó su tiempo de registro o el código de configuración falló demasiadas veces. Apaga y enciende la Power Base y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 지금은 요청을 받지 않습니다. 재등록 대기 시간이 지났거나 설정 코드를 여러 번 틀렸습니다. 아무것도 지우지 않았습니다. BOOT 버튼을 다시 5초 누른 뒤 시도하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll failure: the board closed its window; nothing erased",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base isn’t taking requests right now. Its waiting time is over, or the setup code was wrong several times. Nothing was erased. Hold the BOOT button for 5 seconds again, then try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base no acepta solicitudes en este momento. Se acabó su tiempo de espera o el código de configuración falló varias veces. No se borró nada. Vuelve a mantener pulsado el botón BOOT 5 segundos e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 지우기 요청을 받았지만 아직 끝났다고 확인하지 않았습니다. Power Base는 다시 시작할 때마다 이어서 진행하며, 끝나기 전에는 이전 네트워크로 돌아가지 않습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll result: the board journaled the reset and has not verified it; it carries on at each restart",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base took the erase request but hasn’t confirmed that it is finished. It carries on every time it restarts, and it doesn’t go back to the old network before it is done."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base aceptó la solicitud de borrado, pero aún no ha confirmado que haya terminado. Continúa cada vez que se reinicia y no vuelve a la red anterior antes de terminar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 지우기를 시작하지 않았다고 알려 왔습니다. 기존 등록 정보는 그대로입니다. 필요하면 BOOT 버튼을 다시 5초 누른 뒤 처음부터 진행하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll failure: the board says the reset never started; the registration is intact",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base reported that it didn’t start erasing. The existing registration is unchanged. If needed, hold the BOOT button for 5 seconds again and start over."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base informó de que no empezó a borrar. El registro actual sigue igual. Si hace falta, vuelve a mantener pulsado el botón BOOT 5 segundos y empieza de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base가 켜져 평소처럼 동작하는 상태에서 BOOT 버튼을 5초 동안 누른 뒤 손을 떼세요." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll step 1: hold the BOOT button for 5 seconds on a running board, then release",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With the Power Base on and running as usual, hold its BOOT button for 5 seconds, then let go."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con la Power Base encendida y funcionando con normalidad, mantén pulsado su botón BOOT durante 5 segundos y luego suéltalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base는 가입 정보를 받았고 네트워크에 연결했을 수 있지만, 허브가 정해진 시간 안에 신호를 받지 못했습니다. 보드는 초기화하지 않았고 그대로 둡니다. 잠시 뒤 기기 목록에 나타나는지 확인하세요. 나타나지 않으면 Power Base의 전원을 껐다 켠 뒤 다시 등록하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup result: partly done; nothing was reset",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base received the join information and may have joined the network, but the hub didn’t receive its signal in time. The board was not reset and is left as it is. Check in a moment whether it appears in the device list. If it doesn’t, turn the Power Base off and on, then register it again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base recibió la información de acceso y puede que se haya unido a la red, pero el hub no recibió su señal a tiempo. La placa no se ha restablecido y se deja como está. Comprueba dentro de un momento si aparece en la lista de dispositivos. Si no aparece, apaga y enciende la Power Base y regístrala de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base는 등록 전 상태 그대로입니다. 언제든 다시 등록할 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup result: cancelled; nothing reached the board, or the board confirmed that it stopped",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base is still in its unregistered state. You can register it again at any time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base sigue en su estado sin registrar. Puedes registrarla de nuevo cuando quieras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base는 이 허브의 Thread 네트워크에 가입합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup: hub section footer",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base joins this hub’s Thread network."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base se une a la red Thread de este hub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base는 확인했지만 허브에 전달하지 못했습니다. 허브에 연결된 뒤 '허브에 다시 보내기'를 누르세요. 이 화면을 벗어나면 처음부터 다시 확인해야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Confirm removal failure: the receipt was read but the hub could not be reached",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base was confirmed, but the result couldn’t be delivered to the hub. When the hub is reachable, tap “Send to Hub Again”. If you leave this screen, you’ll have to confirm from the start."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se confirmó la Power Base, pero no se pudo entregar el resultado al hub. Cuando haya conexión con el hub, pulsa “Enviar de nuevo al hub”. Si sales de esta pantalla, tendrás que confirmar desde el principio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base를 등록하려면 설정의 '허브 찾기'에서 허브를 선택해야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup: no hub picked in Find hubs",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To register a Power Base, choose a hub in “Find Hubs” in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para registrar una Power Base, elige un hub en “Buscar hubs” en Ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base를 등록했습니다" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup result title: success",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Power Base Registered"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Power Base registrada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base를 삭제하고 있습니다. 이 단계에서는 취소할 수 없습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: in progress",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base is being removed. It can’t be cancelled at this stage."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
