        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conectado a la Power Base"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base와 센서는 목록에서 빠졌지만, 삭제가 끝났는지는 아직 확인되지 않았습니다. Power Base 가까이에서 아래 '삭제 확인'을 하면 완료됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: out of the hub's lists, not confirmed; how to complete it",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Power Base and its sensors are off the list, but it isn’t confirmed yet that the removal finished. Use “Confirm Removal” below near the Power Base to complete it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La Power Base y sus sensores ya no están en la lista, pero aún no está confirmado que la eliminación haya terminado. Usa “Confirmar eliminación” abajo, cerca de la Power Base, para completarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power Base와 함께 받은 26자리 코드(A–Z, 2–7)를 입력하세요. 코드는 이 화면에서만 쓰이며 저장되지 않습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup: what the setup code is; it is not stored",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the 26-character code (A–Z, 2–7) that came with the Power Base. The code is only used on this screen and is not saved."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Introduce el código de 26 caracteres (A–Z, 2–7) que venía con la Power Base. El código solo se usa en esta pantalla y no se guarda."
          }
        }
      }
