    "공유 끄기" : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings: confirm stop sharing",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop Sharing"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dejar de compartir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "공유 상태" : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings: status row label",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sharing"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uso compartido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "공유하면 집 이름, 방, 조각보 센서의 이름과 방 배치가 같은 허브를 쓰는 기기에 똑같이 표시됩니다. 센서 값, Apple 홈, 언어·화면 설정, Watch에 표시할 값은 공유하지 않습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings footer: what is and isn't shared",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When shared, the home name, rooms, and Jogakbo sensor names and rooms look the same on every device using this hub. Sensor values, Apple Home, language and display settings, and the values shown on Apple Watch aren’t shared."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al compartir, el nombre de la casa, las habitaciones y los nombres y habitaciones de los sensores Jogakbo se ven igual en todos los dispositivos que usan este hub. No se comparten los valores de los sensores, Apple Home, el idioma ni la pantalla, ni los valores que muestra el Apple Watch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "광고한 허브와 응답한 허브가 달라 연결하지 않았습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Hub discovery: advertised and answered hub_id differ",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not connected: the hub that answered isn’t the one that was announced."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se ha conectado: el hub que respondió no es el que se anunció."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "권한 없음" : {
      "comment" : "Watch: Apple Home action failed for lack of permission",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No permission"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sin permiso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "권한 요청에 답하면 Apple 홈의 기기 목록을 가져옵니다." : {
      "comment" : "Apple Home notice: waiting for permission / first home list",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once you answer the permission request, the Apple Home device list is loaded."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando respondas a la solicitud de permiso, se cargará la lista de dispositivos de Apple Home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "그 사이 다른 기기가 먼저 올렸다면 덮어쓰지 않고 그 설정을 사용합니다. 이 기기에 저장된 기존 설정은 그대로 보관됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings setup: first upload never overwrites",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If another device uploaded first in the meantime, its settings are used instead — nothing is overwritten. The settings saved on this device are kept."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si otro dispositivo subió los suyos antes, se usan esos en su lugar: no se sobrescribe nada. Los ajustes guardados en este dispositivo se conservan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "그사이 이 Power Base가 다시 등록되어 목록에서 제거하지 않았습니다. 목록을 새로 확인하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management failure of 'remove from hub list': the Base was registered again meanwhile",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Power Base was registered again in the meantime, so it wasn’t removed from the list. Check the list again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta Power Base se registró de nuevo entretanto, así que no se quitó de la lista. Vuelve a revisar la lista."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "그사이 이 Power Base의 등록이나 삭제 요청 상태가 바뀌어 삭제를 요청하지 않았습니다. 목록을 새로 확인한 뒤 다시 시도하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management failure: the Base was registered again, or a removal was asked of it and ended, after this device read the list; nothing was requested",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Power Base’s registration or its removal request changed in the meantime, so no removal was requested. Check the list again, then try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El registro de esta Power Base o su solicitud de eliminación cambió entretanto, así que no se solicitó la eliminación. Revisa la lista de nuevo e inténtalo otra vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
