    "삭제" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management: confirms the removal\nPower Base management: section header of the delete action",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eliminar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 결과 읽는 중" : {
      "comment" : "Confirm removal step: reading the board's receipt",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reading the Removal Result"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Leyendo el resultado de la eliminación"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 결과를 오랫동안 확인하지 못했습니다. 아직 삭제된 것이 아니며 취소할 수도 없습니다. Power Base가 다시 연결되면 허브가 결과를 확인합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: the outcome cannot be confirmed",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The result of the removal hasn’t been confirmed for a long time. It isn’t removed yet, and it can’t be cancelled. When the Power Base connects again, the hub will check the result."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hace mucho que no se confirma el resultado de la eliminación. Aún no está eliminada y no se puede cancelar. Cuando la Power Base vuelva a conectarse, el hub comprobará el resultado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 대기" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal state: stored on the hub, waiting for the Power Base",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removal Pending"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eliminación pendiente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 뒤 Power Base 가까이에서 '삭제 확인'을 한 번 해야 완료됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management: confirmation dialog, a Base whose removal has to be confirmed once near it afterwards",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Afterwards, confirm the removal once near the Power Base with “Confirm Removal” to complete it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después, confirma la eliminación una vez cerca de la Power Base con “Confirmar eliminación” para completarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 명령이 이미 Power Base로 전달됐을 수 있어 취소할 수 없습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management failure: the job can no longer be cancelled",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The removal command may already have reached the Power Base, so it can’t be cancelled."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede que la orden de eliminación ya haya llegado a la Power Base, así que no se puede cancelar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 미확인" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal state: the Base was taken out of the hub's list after the delete command went out; whether the Power Base erased anything is not confirmed",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removal Unconfirmed"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eliminación sin confirmar"
          }
        }
