    },
    "삭제 요청을 취소했습니다. Power Base는 그대로 등록되어 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: cancelled",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The removal request was cancelled. The Power Base is still registered."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se canceló la solicitud de eliminación. La Power Base sigue registrada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 전에 다시 등록됨" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal state: the board was enrolled again first",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registered Again Before Removal"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registrada de nuevo antes de eliminarse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 중" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal state: the removal is under way and not confirmed yet (the command is with the board, or the board is erasing and reporting by itself)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removing"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eliminando"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 확인" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management: opens the screen that confirms a released Power Base's erase over Bluetooth; also that screen's title and its main button",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confirm Removal"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confirmar eliminación"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제 확인 필요" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal state: the Base is out of the hub's lists; someone has to confirm near it that the removal finished",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confirmation Needed"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falta confirmar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제가 끝났는지 아직 확인되지 않았습니다. Power Base 가까이에서 설정 코드로 확인하면 삭제가 완료됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "Confirm removal: what this screen is for",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It isn’t confirmed yet that the removal finished. Confirm it near the Power Base with its setup code to complete the removal."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún no está confirmado que la eliminación haya terminado. Confírmalo cerca de la Power Base con su código de configuración para completar la eliminación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제가 확인되기 전에 이 Power Base가 다시 등록되어, 이전 삭제 요청은 더 이상 적용되지 않습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: superseded by a new enrollment before the erase was confirmed",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Power Base was registered again before the removal was confirmed, so the earlier removal request no longer applies."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta Power Base se registró de nuevo antes de que se confirmara la eliminación, así que la solicitud anterior ya no se aplica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제되었거나 연결이 해제되었을 수 있습니다. 위젯을 길게 눌러 다시 선택하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Sensor widget: the selected sensor no longer exists, detail",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It may have been removed or disconnected. Touch and hold the widget to choose again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede que se haya eliminado o desconectado. Mantén pulsado el widget para elegir otro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제를 마무리하고 있습니다. 따로 할 일은 없으며, 끝나면 목록에서 사라집니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: out of the hub's lists and finishing by itself; nothing to do, not complete yet",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The removal is finishing. There’s nothing you need to do; it leaves the list when it’s done."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La eliminación está terminando. No tienes que hacer nada; saldrá de la lista cuando acabe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제를 확인하지 못했습니다" : {
      "comment" : "Confirm removal: failure title",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removal Not Confirmed"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se confirmó la eliminación"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제하면 연결된 센서도 기기 목록과 Apple 홈에서 사라지고 방 지정이 해제됩니다. 센서 모듈에 저장된 정보는 지워지지 않습니다. 다시 사용하려면 'Power Base 추가'에서 새로 등록하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management: under the delete button -- what a removal does to the sensors and their rooms, and that the Base has to be registered again",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removing a Power Base also removes its sensors from the device list and from Apple Home and clears their room assignments. Information stored on sensor modules is not erased. To use it again, register it anew in “Add Power Base”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al eliminar una Power Base, sus sensores también desaparecen de la lista de dispositivos y de Apple Home, y se quitan sus habitaciones asignadas. La información guardada en los módulos de sensor no se borra. Para volver a usarla, regístrala de nuevo en “Añadir Power Base”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "삭제했습니다. 다시 사용하려면 'Power Base 추가'에서 새로 등록하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: completed",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removed. To use it again, register it anew in “Add Power Base”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eliminada. Para volver a usarla, regístrala de nuevo en “Añadir Power Base”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "상세 정보를 엽니다" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of an Apple Home tile body",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens details"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abre los detalles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "상태" : {
