    "소스" : {
      "comment" : "Build details: section header for the source identity",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Source"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Código fuente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "소스 상태" : {
      "comment" : "Build details: clean or with uncommitted changes",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Source State"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estado del código fuente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "소스 정보는 빌드 도구로 만든 빌드에만 기록됩니다. 기록되지 않은 값은 '알 수 없음'으로 표시하며 추정하지 않습니다. 같은 커밋이라도 커밋하지 않은 변경이 다르면 소스 지문이 다릅니다." : {
      "comment" : "Build details: where the source identity comes from; nothing is guessed",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Source information is only recorded in builds made with the build tool. A value that wasn’t recorded is shown as “Unknown”; it is never guessed. Even on the same commit, different uncommitted changes give a different source fingerprint."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La información del código fuente solo se registra en las compilaciones hechas con la herramienta de compilación. Un valor no registrado se muestra como “Desconocido”; nunca se supone. Incluso en el mismo commit, cambios sin confirmar distintos dan una huella distinta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "소스 지문" : {
      "comment" : "Build details: the source fingerprint (a hash of the sources)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Source Fingerprint"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Huella del código fuente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "손상된 JSON 응답입니다: %@" : {
      "comment" : "API error",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Malformed JSON response: %@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Respuesta JSON dañada: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "손을 떼면 Power Base가 다시 시작해 약 2분 동안 재등록을 기다립니다. 그동안 센서 데이터 전송은 잠시 멈춥니다." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll step 2: the board restarts and waits about two minutes; data pauses",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you let go, the Power Base restarts and waits about 2 minutes to be registered again. Sensor data pauses during that time."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al soltarlo, la Power Base se reinicia y espera unos 2 minutos para volver a registrarse. Durante ese tiempo se interrumpen los datos de los sensores."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "수정 충돌" : {
      "comment" : "Shared settings status",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Edit Conflict"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conflicto de edición"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "순서: ① Power Base의 기존 등록 정보를 지웁니다(확인 후에만). ② 새 허브에 등록합니다. 두 단계는 따로 확인됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll: the two parts of the procedure, confirmed separately",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Order: ① The Power Base’s existing registration is erased (only after you confirm). ② It is registered with the new hub. Each step is confirmed separately."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orden: ① Se borra el registro actual de la Power Base (solo después de que confirmes). ② Se registra en el nuevo hub. Cada paso se confirma por separado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
