    "아직 읽지 않음" : {
      "comment" : "Sensor widget: Apple Home listed the value but PogoHome hasn't read it yet",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not read yet"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún sin leer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "아직 찾지 못했습니다. BOOT 버튼을 5초 동안 누른 뒤 손을 뗐는지, Power Base가 가까이 있는지 확인하세요. Power Base는 약 2분 동안만 기다리므로 시간이 지났다면 BOOT 버튼을 다시 5초 누르세요." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll: nothing found after a while, with what to check",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing found yet. Check that you held the BOOT button for 5 seconds and let go, and that the Power Base is nearby. It only waits about 2 minutes; if that time has passed, hold the BOOT button for 5 seconds again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún no se ha encontrado nada. Comprueba que mantuviste pulsado el botón BOOT 5 segundos y lo soltaste, y que la Power Base está cerca. Solo espera unos 2 minutos; si ya pasaron, vuelve a mantener pulsado el botón BOOT 5 segundos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "아직 찾지 못했습니다. Power Base는 전원을 켠 뒤 15분 동안만 Bluetooth로 응답합니다. Power Base 가까이에서 전원을 껐다 켠 뒤 다시 찾아보세요." : {
      "comment" : "Confirm removal: the board was not found, with what to do",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not found yet. A Power Base only answers over Bluetooth for 15 minutes after it is powered on. Near the Power Base, turn it off and on, then search again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún no se ha encontrado. Una Power Base solo responde por Bluetooth durante 15 minutos tras encenderse. Cerca de la Power Base, apágala y enciéndela y busca de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "아직 찾지 못했습니다. Power Base의 전원이 켜져 있는지, 가까이 있는지 확인하세요. Power Base는 전원을 켠 뒤 15분 동안만 등록을 기다리므로, 시간이 지났다면 전원을 껐다 켜세요. 이미 등록된 Power Base는 여기에 나타나지 않습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup: nothing found after a while, with what to check",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nothing found yet. Make sure the Power Base is powered on and nearby. A Power Base only waits for registration for 15 minutes after it is powered on, so if that time has passed, turn it off and on. A Power Base that is already registered doesn’t appear here."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún no se ha encontrado nada. Comprueba que la Power Base está encendida y cerca. Una Power Base solo espera el registro durante 15 minutos tras encenderse; si ya pasó ese tiempo, apágala y enciéndela. Una Power Base ya registrada no aparece aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
