            "value" : "No hay sensores Jogakbo conectados. Los módulos aparecerán aquí cuando se conecten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "연결된 허브가 '허브 목록에서 제거'를 지원하지 않습니다. 허브를 업데이트해야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management failure of 'remove from hub list': the hub is too old",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connected hub doesn’t support “Remove from Hub List”. The hub needs to be updated."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El hub conectado no admite “Quitar de la lista del hub”. Hay que actualizar el hub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "연결된 허브가 Power Base 정보를 보내지 않습니다. 새 Power Base를 확인하려면 허브를 업데이트해야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Bridge too old",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connected hub doesn't report Power Bases. Update the hub to see a new Power Base."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El hub conectado no informa de Power Bases. Actualiza el hub para ver una nueva Power Base."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "연결된 허브가 삭제 확인을 받는 기능을 지원하지 않습니다. 허브를 업데이트해야 합니다." : {
      "comment" : "Confirm removal failure: the hub has no receipt route",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connected hub doesn’t support receiving removal confirmations. The hub needs to be updated."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El hub conectado no admite recibir confirmaciones de eliminación. Hay que actualizar el hub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "연결된 허브가 앱에서 Power Base를 등록하는 기능을 지원하지 않습니다. 허브를 업데이트해야 합니다. Power Base에는 아무것도 전달하지 않았습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup failure: hub too old or enrollment not enabled",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connected hub doesn’t support registering a Power Base from the app. The hub needs to be updated. Nothing was sent to the Power Base."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El hub conectado no admite registrar una Power Base desde la app. Hay que actualizar el hub. No se envió nada a la Power Base."
          }
