    "지우기 요청은 이미 Power Base로 보냈고, 그 결과를 아직 확인하지 못했습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll result: a check of the outcome failed; followed by why",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The erase request was already sent to the Power Base, and its result hasn’t been confirmed yet."
