        }
      }
    },
    "지우기 요청은 이미 Power Base로 보냈지만 결과를 받지 못했습니다. 지워졌을 수도, 아닐 수도 있습니다. 취소된 것이 아닙니다." : {
      "comment" : "Re-enroll result: the command was sent, the answer was lost; not cancelled",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The erase request was already sent to the Power Base, but no result came back. The registration may or may not have been erased. It was not cancelled."
