    "취소를 요청했지만 Power Base가 이미 가입 정보를 받은 뒤였습니다. 보드는 초기화하지 않았습니다. 기기 목록에 나타나면 등록된 것이고, 나타나지 않으면 전원을 껐다 켠 뒤 다시 등록할 수 있습니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base setup result: cancelled after the board had the request",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancellation was requested, but the Power Base had already received the join information. The board was not reset. If it appears in the device list, it is registered; if it doesn’t, turn it off and on and register it again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se pidió la cancelación, pero la Power Base ya había recibido la información de acceso. La placa no se ha restablecido. Si aparece en la lista de dispositivos, está registrada; si no aparece, apágala y enciéndela y regístrala de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
