    "허브 ID가 없는 서비스" : {
      "comment" : "Hub discovery row: the announcement has no hub_id",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Service without a hub ID"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Servicio sin ID de hub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "허브 ID를 알려주지 않는 서비스라 연결할 수 없습니다. 허브를 최신 버전으로 업데이트하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Hub discovery: the service has no hub_id",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can’t connect: this service doesn’t report a hub ID. Update the hub to the latest version."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se puede conectar: este servicio no indica un ID de hub. Actualiza el hub a la última versión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "허브 목록에서 제거" : {
      "comment" : "Power Base management: section header and button -- takes an offline Power Base out of this hub's list; this is not the removal",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remove from Hub List"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quitar de la lista del hub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "허브 목록에서는 제거됐습니다. 그 전에 보낸 삭제 명령이 Power Base에서 실행됐는지는 확인되지 않았습니다. Power Base가 응답하면 허브가 결과를 확인하고, 다시 등록하면 이 기록은 사라집니다." : {
      "comment" : "Power Base removal: the Base is out of the hub's list for certain; whether the delete command sent before that was carried out on the Power Base is not confirmed; what ends this record",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It was removed from the hub’s list. Whether the removal command sent before that was carried out on the Power Base isn’t confirmed. If the Power Base answers, the hub will check the result; if you register it again, this record goes away."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se quitó de la lista del hub. No está confirmado si la orden de eliminación enviada antes se ejecutó en la Power Base. Si la Power Base responde, el hub comprobará el resultado; si la registras de nuevo, este registro desaparece."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "허브 설정 공유" : {
